["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>住宿；旅馆；寄宿；怀孕；驿站</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やど・やど.る・やど.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿題</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">功课；作业；悬而未决的问题；未解决的课题</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">下宿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げしゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">寄宿；租住；食宿；寄宿处；租住处；下宿处</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旅馆；客栈；酒店；家；住所；住宅；仆人父母（或担保人等）的住处</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">薬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>药；火药；釉；益处</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くすり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">薬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くすり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">药；医药；药物；药品；丸剂；软膏；药膏；有效的化学物质；火药；农药；陶釉；釉料；毒品；麻醉药品；违禁药物；小贿赂；小恩小惠</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">薬指</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くすりゆび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">无名指（尤指钢琴演奏中的第四指）；第四趾</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">農薬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のうやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">农药；农业化学物质</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">険</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>危险；险峻；险恶；难以接近；锐利（目光）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">けわ.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危険</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险；危难；危害；风险；危险</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冒険</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冒险；冒险活动；冒险；危险；风险；危殆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">険しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けわしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">陡峭的；险峻的；崎岖的；难以通行的；险要的；严峻的；严厉的；严肃的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">頼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>信任；请求；依靠；委托</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ライ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たの.む・たの.もしい・たよ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頼む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たのむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">请求；恳求；乞求；呼叫；订购；预订；委托；托付；依靠；依赖；请；拜托了；帮帮忙</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">依頼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">请求；委托；委任；依赖；依靠</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">信頼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">信任；信赖；信心</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">覚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>记住；感觉；醒来；醒悟；学会</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おぼ.える・さ.ま