；褪色；变色；磨破；穿破（如衣服）；离开；退出（如会议）；清澈；透明（如天空）；心不在焉；粗心；不专心；愚蠢；退出循环（程序）；穿过；通过；垮掉；倒塌；得分超过88分而获胜（不含得分组合的积分）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海抜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいばつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海拔；海拔高度</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">便</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>便利；信件；粪便；机会</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ベン・ビン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たよ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">便利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便利；方便；实用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮便局；邮局</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不便</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふべん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不便；不方便；麻烦</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">留</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>停止；停留；固定；扣留；保留</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リュウ・ル</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.める・と.まる・とど.める・とど.まる・るうぶる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留学生</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゅうがくせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">留学生；交换学生</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留守</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">るす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不在家；外出；离家；看家；看家人；荒废；疏于看管；怠忽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留学</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゅうがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">留学；（暂时）到另一所学校学习（以学习特定技能）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">罪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>罪；犯罪；过错；责任；责备</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">罪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罪行；罪过；轻率行为；不当行为；刑罚；判决；惩罚；过错；责任；应负的责任；轻率；欠考虑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯罪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯罪；犯法；违法行为</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">努</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>尽力；勤勉；尽可能</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ド</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努力</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どりょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">努力；尽力；奋力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">努力；竭力；尽力；致力；奋力；尽心尽力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努めて</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめて</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尽可能地；尽力；勤勉地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">精</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>精神；精华；精力；详细；精灵</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しら.げる・くわ.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精神</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">心；精神；灵魂；心境；气质；态度；心态；意志；意图；（事物的）精髓；本质；根本意义</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいぜい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">最多；至多；尽力；尽可能；竭尽全力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精巧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">精巧；精致；精美</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">散</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>散落；分散；散布；挥霍；散开</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ち.る・ち.らす・-ち.らす・ち.らかす・ち.らかる・ち.らばる・ばら・ばら.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">散歩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんぽ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">散步；漫步</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解散</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">散会；解散（会议、集会等）；解散；清算；遣散；分裂（公司、组织等）；解散（议会、国会等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">散る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（花瓣、叶子等）飘落；凋落；散开；分散；消失；消散；瓦解；扩散；晕开；洇开；壮烈牺牲；英勇战死</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">静</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>安静；平静；静止；平息；使安静</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しず-・しず.か・しず.まる・しず.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">静か</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しずか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安静</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷静</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷静；沉着；镇定；泰然自若</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">静まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しずまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变安静；安静下来；平静下来；平复；消退；减弱；消散；被压制</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">婚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>婚姻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">結婚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">婚姻；结婚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">婚約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">订婚；婚约</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">離婚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">离婚</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">喜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>欢喜；高兴；喜悦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろこ.ぶ・よろこ.ばす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よろこぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高兴；欣喜；愉快；喜悦；祝贺；道贺；欢迎；乐于接受；乐意（做）；欣然（做）；高兴（做）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜び</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よろこび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜悦；欢乐；狂喜；愉快；满足；庆贺；祝贺</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜劇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きげき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜剧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">浮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>漂浮；浮起；浮现；浮出水面；浮动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.く・う.かれる・う.かぶ・う.かべる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漂浮；浮起；变得高兴；快乐；愉快；变得松动；不稳定；感到格格不入；感到孤立；显得突兀；轻浮；不确定；游移不定；有所剩余；节省下来；无根据；不可靠；靠不住</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮かぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うかぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">浮动；悬浮；浮上；出现；浮现；显现；浮现在脑海中；产生灵感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮かべる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うかべる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使漂浮；使浮起；下水；（脸上）浮现；显露；想起；回忆；想象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">絶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>断绝；中断；抑制；超越；绝无仅有</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.える・た.やす・た.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶対</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜったい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">绝对地；一定；无条件地；绝对的；无条件的；确定无疑的；绝对性</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶滅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜつめつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灭绝；消灭；根除；消灭；扑灭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶えず</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たえず</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不断地；持续地；始终</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">幸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>幸福；幸运；福气</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さいわ.い・さち・しあわ.せ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸運</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こううん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">好运；幸运</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸福</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幸福；福祉；快乐；安康；幸福感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいわい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幸福；幸运；福气；好运；幸而得到好结果；结果顺利；有幸告终；幸运地；幸而；幸好</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">押</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>按压；推挤；压制；扣留；加盖（印章）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.す・お.し-・お.っ-・お.さえる・おさ.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">推；推动；用力推；按；按下；压；盖章；钤印；加盖印章；贴；粘贴（如金箔）；催促；施压；向某人施加压力；压倒；压制；使某人承受压力；占上风；推行；推进；继续执行（政策、计划等）；顶住；不顾；冒着；推开；确认；核实；落后于日程；延误；（围棋）压；顶着对方棋子延伸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押し入れ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おしいれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">壁橱；衣柜；推拉门柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おさえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">按住；压住；按压；固定；用手捂住（身体部位）；紧握（疼痛部位）；按压；抓住；获得；夺取；逮捕；掌握（要点）；理解；预留（时间、空间）；占住；锁定（日期）；预约；平定；镇压；抑制；遏制；控制；阻止</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">倒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>倒下；倒塌；推翻；颠倒；垮掉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たお.れる・-だお.れ・たお.す・さかさま・さかさ・さかしま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たおれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倒下；跌倒；摔倒；倾覆；被摧毁；坍塌；崩裂；崩坏；倒塌；卧床不起；患病；累垮；死亡；被杀；破产；倒闭；衰落；失败；战败；输掉；推翻；被推翻；失去政权</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たおす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">推倒；击倒；砍倒；放倒；使侧卧；使倾斜；杀死；打败；击败；推翻；绊倒；毁坏；拖欠；欺骗；彻底做；充分做；尽力做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">面倒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；烦恼；困难；麻烦；照顾；关照</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">等</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>相等；等等；等级；类似；相同</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひと.しい・など・-ら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高等学校</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうとうがっこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高中；高级中学</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">上等</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">上等；一流；优秀；上乘；好极了；来啊；尽管来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">平等</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平等；公平；均等</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">老</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>年老；衰老；老人；老衰；老迈</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.いる・ふ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老年；衰老；衰老过程；老人；老年人；年长者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうじん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老人；老年人；年长者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老衰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衰老；老年衰弱；年迈体衰</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>弯曲；音乐；旋律；作曲；歪曲</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.がる・ま.げる・くま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">曲る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まがる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弯曲；弯折；翘曲；蜿蜒；扭曲；转向；转弯；歪斜；不正；扭曲不正</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作曲</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さっきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">作曲；谱曲；音乐创作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">曲線</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょくせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">曲线</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">払</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>支付；清除；修剪；驱逐；处理</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フツ・ヒツ・ホツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はら.う・-はら.い・-ばら.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">払う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はらう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">支付（如金钱、账单等）；拂去；擦去；清除；掸去；砍断（如树枝）；赶走；驱逐（如竞争对手）；变卖；卖掉；处理（不需要的东西）；给予；表示（如注意力、尊重、关切）；付出；花费；耗费（如努力、牺牲）；搬出；腾出（自己的住处）；扫（如腿）；挥开；推开；（书法）写出撇、捺等扫笔；（算盘）清盘；复位</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支払</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しはらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">支付；付款</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支払う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しはらう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">支付；付款</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">庭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>庭院；院子；花园</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">にわ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">庭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">花园；院子；庭院；领域；范围；活动范围</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">家庭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">家庭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">校庭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">校园；操场；运动场；学校场地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">徒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>门徒；徒步；徒劳；空虚；一伙人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ト</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いたずら・あだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生徒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">学生；生徒；学童</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">徒歩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とほ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">步行；徒步；走路</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勤</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>勤奋；任职；服务；勤勉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン・ゴン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つと.める・-づと.め・つと.まる・いそ.しむ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勤める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">在……工作；受雇于；供职于；担任；充当；出任……职务；扮演……角色；主持宗教仪式；进行宗教活动</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勤め</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">职务；职责；工作；责任；任务；佛教法事；佛事</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">出勤</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅっきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">上班；出勤；到岗；报到</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">遅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>慢；晚；迟；拖延；落后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おく.れる・おく.らす・おそ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遅い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おそい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">慢；缓慢；晚；迟；太晚；为时已晚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遅れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おくれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迟到；延误；落后于日程；落后；滞后；跟不上时代；（亲人）先逝；失去（亲人）；（钟表）走慢</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遅刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迟到；晚到；来迟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">居</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>居住；存在；在；处于；生活</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ・コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.る・-い・お.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">居間</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起居室；客厅</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">居る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（谦让语）在；有；存在（指人或动物）；正在……；在……中；（接动词て形）……着；已……（表状态持续）；（接动词连用形，表轻蔑）竟敢……；居然……</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">戏剧；话剧；剧目</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">雑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>混杂；混合；杂乱的；杂项</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザツ・ゾウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まじ.える・まじ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雑誌</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざっし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">杂志；期刊；刊物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">複雑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくざつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">复杂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">混雑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんざつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拥挤；拥堵；拥塞；堵塞；混乱；纷乱；无序</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">招</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>招引；邀请；召唤；聘用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まね.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">招待</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邀请；招待</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">招く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まねく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邀请；招待；招手；挥手示意；做手势；召来；传唤；召集；招致；引起；造成；导致；惹来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">招き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まねき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邀请；招待</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">困</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>困扰；为难；苦恼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こま.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">困る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">为难；发愁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">困難</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんなん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">困难；艰难；困苦；窘迫；不可行；难以实施；无法执行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貧困</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひんこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贫困；赤贫；贫乏；穷困；短缺；缺乏；不足</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">欠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>缺乏；缺口；失败；欠缺</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケツ・ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.ける・か.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠陥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缺陷；缺点；瑕疵；畸形；不足；短缺；漏洞</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠席</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缺席；不出席</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けってん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缺点；缺陷；弱点；不足；短处；（考试）不及格；不合格成绩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">更</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>更（更加）；再（再次）；加深（程度）；更替（更新）；夜深（时间晚）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さら・さら.に・ふ.ける・ふ.かす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">更に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さらに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">而且；再者；况且；愈加；越来越；更加</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">変更</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变更；修改；变动；更改；修订</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">更ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天色渐晚；时间推移；夜深</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>雕刻；切细；剁碎；时间；刻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きざ.む・きざ.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">時刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">时刻；时间；有利时机；机会；良机</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">严重；严肃</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遅刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迟到；晚到；来迟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">賛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>赞同；赞美；题赞（画上题词）；协助；同意</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たす.ける・たた.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">賛成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赞成；同意；支持；赞许</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">賛美</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赞美；颂扬；称颂</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">犯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>犯罪；冒犯；侵犯</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン・ボン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おか.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯罪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯罪；犯法；违法行为</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯人；罪犯；作案人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">防犯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯罪预防；防止犯罪；安全防护；防盗（设备、摄像头等）</span></li></ul></div></li>"]